 "proof_obligation": "bridge",
 "diagnosis": "The postcondition 0<=i<=v.Length-1 is too strong. When v contains no negative elements (including the empty array, v.Length==0), the loop ends with i==v.Length, as the documentation says ('len if not any'). The invariant 0<=i<=j+1<=v.Length together with the exit condition i>j only gives 0<=i<=v.Length, so the postcondition cannot be proved. Fix: weaken it to 0<=i<=v.Length."}

